            <ArticleTitle>Pain management for patients with chest drains.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>40-4; quiz 44-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The management of pain for patients with chest drains has been largely neglected. This article reviews the evidence and describes how applying a theoretical model can help patients undergoing this painful invasive procedure.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
